'''Donut''' is an [[uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by [[crafting]] it or through trading. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is dull pink in color with sprinkles varying in different colors all over it. The guard is tan, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/18586528/profile Chris12902].
*This knife, along with many other knives are from other Murder games. ''For example: Murder by CloneTrooper1019''.
*The description of this knife is: "In an alternate universe, in a place called Prophunt, there are pyros. Nobody knows what's behind the mask and what the pyro thinks. This is the closest thing we could find to Pyroland."<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/161529730/SKIN-Donut-Knife Model created by Chris12902]</ref>
*Players can exchange 12 common [[shards]] through [[crafting]] to obtain it by chance.
* When salvaged, it provides 2 uncommon [[shards]].

